Chapter: NegIntParse

 Minimal repro: text-to-integer must detect a leading minus and return a
 negative value. The minus sign is CCE 73; ARM64's a64-rt-text-to-integer
 compared the first byte against CCE 71 (apostrophe) and so never negated,
 mis-parsing the minus as a digit.

Section: Body

  opening : Integer =
   text-to-integer "-5"
